": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 112, "end": 146, "text": "Paul, Nebraska, was built in 1912."}, "D7S5": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 147, "end": 198, "text": "It was designed by Berlinghof & Davis and George A."}, "D7S6": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 199, "end": 237, "text": "Berlinghof in Classical Revival style."}, "D7S7": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 238, "end": 314, "text": "It is a four-story building made of brick and of Bedford, Indiana limestone."}, "D7S8": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 315, "end": 381, "text": "It was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1990."}, "D7S9": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 382, "end": 457, "text": "The listing included one contributing building and one contributing object."}, "D7S10": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 458, "end": 586, "text": "It was deemed significant architecturally and for its association with local politics and government of Howard County, Nebraska."}, "D7S11": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d06", "start": 587, "end": 631, "text": "It was asserted to be \"an important example\""}, "D8S1": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d07", "start": 0, "end": 1, "text": "."}, "D8S2": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d07", "start": 2, "end": 141, "text": "`` I ca n't tell you how many times I pray before I go to bed because it 's truly difficult to secure the old courthouse , '' Harris said ."}, "D8S3": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d07", "start": 142, "end": 198, "text": "`` I pray every night that nothing happens on my watch ."}, "D8S4": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0477-3f0367c85491:d07", "start": 199, "